<title>USA: Duke buys office, begins developments.</title>
<headline>Duke buys office, begins developments.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duke Realty Investments Inc said Tuesday it has purchased an office complex in the Cincinnati area and has begun three other developments.</p>
<p>The company said it expects a stabilized return of 11.1 percent on its aggregate investment of $62.6 million in the new properties.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
